WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.675
Step four:

2
00:00:00.675 --> 00:00:05.060
isolate. Move every energy-isolating
device to the safe position:

3
00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.409
open the disconnect,

4
00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:11.266
close the valves. A control-panel
stop button is not an isolation point.

5
00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:15.583
Step five: apply your own lock
and tag to every isolation point.

6
00:00:15.583 --> 00:00:17.607
One person, one lock, one key.

7
00:00:17.607 --> 00:00:19.226
Your key stays with you.

8
00:00:19.226 --> 00:00:24.555
Use a tag alone only where your written
procedure says a lock can't be applied,

9
00:00:24.555 --> 00:00:26.645
and then with extra protection.
